# Daily content monitor

When the user asks for a **daily update**, **morning briefing**, “any new Syria/Canada content?”, or source-driven **content planning**:

1. Follow the project skill [`.cursor/skills/daily-content-monitor/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/daily-content-monitor/SKILL.md).
2. Use [`docs/MONITORING_CHECKLIST.md`](docs/MONITORING_CHECKLIST.md) as the source list (Daily / Immediate minimum).
3. Produce a **content plan** (must / should / draft-only / no change) — do **not** auto-merge sanctions or figures to `main`.
4. After the user confirms ingest, apply the References-on-content rule in the same PR.
